capability stats/variance  the sample and the population variance, exact then rounded once
  heroes  stats.variance, stats.population_variance
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  statistics.variance, statistics.pvariance
  note    exact as Python's, equal to the last bit on 600 sets; past the largest float `does_not_fit` where Python raises OverflowError. With an infinity among the values Python answers the infinity of the sum, negative where it is; this answers the positive infinity, since a spread is never negative

capability stats/deviation  the sample and the population standard deviation, the root of the exact variance rounded once
  heroes  stats.standard_deviation, stats.population_standard_deviation
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  statistics.stdev, statistics.pstdev
  note    the root of the exact fraction, rounded once, as Python's: equal on 600 sets, and finite where the variance is not (2^1023 and -2^1023 give the root of two times 2^1023 in both). With an infinity Python raises ValueError and this answers the positive infinity, or a nan beside a nan or both infinities

